############ M2: the gate trusts the exit code again, AND the stub exits 0 again -- must go RED ############
  (mutation landed: in the installer, `[ "$(systemctl is-active ...)" = active ]` becomes
   `systemctl is-active ... >/dev/null 2>&1`; in the harness, the netwatch stub's
   `{ echo inactive; exit 3; } || { echo active; exit 0; }` becomes `{ echo inactive; } || { echo active; }`)
  This is the original defect restored on BOTH sides, and it has to be both: a gate that trusts the
  exit code is only wrong when the fixture exits 0, and a fixture that exits 0 is only wrong when
  something trusts it. One of the two alone is green -- see docs 114 section 6.

